1
00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:19,390
Last week I went to the theatre.

2
00:00:19,390 --> 00:00:22,070
I had a very good seat.

3
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:25,100
The play was very interesting.

4
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,430
I did not enjoy it.

5
00:00:27,430 --> 00:00:31,960
A young man and a young woman were sitting behind me.

6
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,590
They were talking loudly.

7
00:00:34,590 --> 00:00:37,410
I got very angry.

8
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:40,640
I could not hear the actors.

9
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,800
I turned round.

10
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:47,270
I looked at the man and the woman angrily.

11
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:50,690
They did not pay any attention.

12
00:00:50,690 --> 00:00:54,980
In the end, I could not bear it.

13
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:57,750
I turned round again.

14
00:00:57,750 --> 00:01:00,819
"I can't hear a word!"

15
00:01:00,819 --> 00:01:03,450
I said angrily.

16
00:01:03,450 --> 00:01:09,000
"It's none of your business," the young man said rudely.

17
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:15,542
"This is a private conversation!"
